### NEXT (noob)

`noob` is on. After this step, tell the user what to run next, with a one-line why. Do **not** run it unless this skill already chains it (`auto_plan` / `auto_build` / `auto_close` / yolo).

**Recommended** — from `issue-flow agent state --json`; do **not** blindly print `next_command` when there is no focus:

- Focus exists → `next_command` (plan / build / close).
- No focus, `epic_hint.epics` non-empty → `/iflow` when `epic_session` is set (name the first `next_candidates` number), else `/iflow-pick`.
- No focus, `epic_session` set, `epic_hint.epics` empty → `issue-flow agent epic-status <epic> --json`: unpublished specs in the current stage → `/iflow-issue epic <N> publish`, else `/iflow-status`.
- Else → `next_command` (usually `/iflow-pick`).

